!src/api/**

# Engine HTTP cache + any legacy pipeline output that auto-regenerates.
# Pipeline state lives in ~/thesis/; this directory is implementation detail.
.thesis/

# Private migration plan — gitignored before public release (per CLAUDE.md).
# The author keeps it locally as the authoritative phase plan.
STEPS.md

# Internal design specs + implementation plans — kept locally as a working
# history of the migration, but not relevant to repo consumers. The privacy
# notice that used to live here has been promoted to PRIVACY.md at the root.
docs/

# Skill library — only the production investment-research skills are tracked
# in this public repo. Everything else under .claude/skills/ is the author's local
# skill collection (mostly symlinks into ~/.claude/skills/, broken for anyone
# cloning). Keep README.md tracked so the in-repo skill set is documented.
.claude/skills/*
